# Goal: one Vulkan submit for host activation -> resident packed GEMV -> host result.
#
# Warm steady-state weight must already be resident. If it is not, ensureWeightQuant/
# ensureWeightF32 uploads it first; the measured gate already requires zero new
# weight uploads after warmup.
#
# Apply:
#   git -C F:\~dev apply --3way 0016_single_submit_weight_roundtrip.patch

